  knight who actually betrayed king arthur  just like ironside had done  it is clear right off the bat that the  black knight is far  stronger than the average human and no  one in the village except for percival  stands a chance  against him so percival decides to  challenge him to a fight  saying that if he wins then the black  knight must tell  percival where his father is the black  knight agrees but he also says that if  he wins  then percival has to agree to come along  with him the black knight is surprised  by percival's strength and his ability  to actually put up a fight  using nothing but his bare hands so  pelgart wants to raise percival  as his own disciple unfortunately for  percival  without a weapon and without any magic  he simply can't take the black  knight down it really doesn't look good  for percival  as the black knight seems to be  dominating the fight but  then that fox that has been watching the  entire thing unfold  appears to do something or say something  and then  suddenly percival's fists are enveloped  by some sort of  magical energy this unknown power forces  the black knight back  and even he doesn't know what kind of  magic this is  and that is how this chapter the third  chapter  ends man i am definitely enjoying this  story  so far this is a strong beginning for a  brand new manga adventure  and i'm very curious to learn more about  percival's powers  and the true intentions of ironside and  on top of all the action and mystery we  already have some great humor elements  like the elba scene which reminds me a  lot of the original seven deadly sins  i gotta admit i do hope that we're gonna  see the return of at least some of the  characters from the original manga  sometime soon including of course  tristan and lancelot  since i'm sure they're going to be main  characters in this story  along with percival but let me know what  you guys think what kind of magic  does percival have is this a latent  power of his own  or is it related to that mysterious fox  also  what's the deal with ironside and  pelgart they don't seem like good guys  so are they both traitors who are using  forbidden magic like maybe demon magic  or a fragment of chaos magic  like did they maybe steal a fragment of  chaos from king arthur  and if so what is their ultimate goal  why are they using familiars to  terrorize these innocent villagers  finally assuming that all of this is  taking place in camelot  what do you think that arthur and merlin  are up to why don't they do something to  stop these  sketchy knights like ironside and  pelgard are they maybe busy dealing with  an  even bigger threat don't forget to share  your thoughts down in the comments below  if you enjoyed this video and you want  to see more seven deadly sins  and sequel videos please leave that like  and subscribe it really means a lot  remember that once you subscribe you  also have to go through the trouble of  hitting that bell  and then selecting the option that says  all i know it's annoying it's an extra  step but if you don't do that you're  still gonna miss a ton of our videos  even if you are subscribed  it's just how youtube works you can also  hit me up on twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  a big thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons for making videos like  this one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma  disciple of lord twego  himself and i can't forget all of our  the one  tier patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans  including ingrata the world acquired  respect pate heffa liam thompson  al-jatal  dr cortman johnny boy draws emperor  otaku spidey life canal  big buddhist and tungsten tarkis finally  thank you to all of our pro hero tier  patrons including the one and only  gilgamesh steelers  angel cruz anatoly kazatsky joe stanton  very gucci jessica califond rathu in  deora alicia octor bonnie parks hinokami  and water the red-haired raven joanne  garcia jack watches anime fat boy games  deadly saint matthew cruz and  anthony schreiber if you enjoy our  videos and you feel that they provide  value to you consider supporting us  on patreon even a single dollar will  give you access to our patron exclusive  discord  and your name will appear in our videos  along with these  legendary people as always thank you  guys so much for watching  and until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

